A tool must not autonomously dispatch emergency alerts merely because an LLM inferred that it would be appropriate.

If an SOS tool is genuinely required, gate it using the same authenticated active-job checks, explicit user confirmation, one-time authorization or confirmation token, idempotency, auditing, and delivery-status handling required by the REST endpoint.

An AI-generated action must never bypass the application's emergency confirmation flow.

